{"parse": {"title": "AR-3", "pageid": 89273, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-2\" title=\"AR-2\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-3</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-4\" title=\"AR-4\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">3</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BC.82.E6.B5.81.E7.9A.84.E7.AD.94.E6.A1.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"漂流的答案\">漂流的答案</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 漂流的答案</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Answer in a Bottle</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>怎么样，每个步骤都记下来了，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>是的，我把它们按顺序编上号，做了记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>太好了，这是很重要的材料！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>现在要准备的是第二题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>素色袍子们井然有序地进行着游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个属于孩童们的，最简单的小游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在除错师看来，这多少有些滑稽——这些头脑本该属于更杰出的难题，可他们现在却一丝不苟地在沙滩上做问答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……您觉得这个游戏真的有深意吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到苏菲亚的话，正在做着记录的女性转头对她微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>哎呀，您感到无聊了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……不，不是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>37认为，只要完成了这个游戏，就能明白答案构成的数列意味着什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我知道父亲，他是个务实、公正的人，从来看重眼前实在的事务。他和我一样，对抽象的东西缺乏感知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我想他的笔记中并不会有37历来寻找的超验的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>嗯……说实话，如果仅从表面看，这些题目的确一眼就能读到结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>每道题目的答案能组成一个十位数，6333434533。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>我看不出它的价值，但37这样做一定有道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>毕竟，她总是能率先洞悉我们所不能及的“本质”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……本质……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那之前，她从未把父亲的笔记本和这个词联想起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一本儿童的习题集，能有什么抽象的、超验的“本质”呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>如果这只是白白浪费时间，或者消磨大家的信任……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>那我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除错师不安地蹙紧眉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有义务纠正眼前的错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚，你在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好友好奇的脸突然出现在眼前，让她猝不及防地后退了半步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……没什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迅速调整好了神态，将一点儿慌乱掩藏起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我只是在思考，37。这个游戏对于大家来说，会不会过于简单？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37歪了歪头，很自然地发表了不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可是数字没有优劣之分，问题的答案也同样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>最简单的数字里往往蕴含着最深刻的道理，这就是为何“1”是单子，是一切思想的起源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这个笔记本里的问题也一样，我是这么想的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……当然，你总是正确的，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但是比起这么简单的游戏，也许我们还有——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>还有更重要的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对话的下半句被37全然说中，这使红发的除错师再次陷入了短暂的慌张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37的目光紧追不放，她向前迈出一步，连珠炮般提出自己的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚总是把这几个字挂在嘴上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——那对苏菲亚来说，最重要的事是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回答理应有很多——关于“流溢”的研究，关于学派的公共事务，关于这座小岛的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不，走开，37！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我知道你是对的，你总是对的。但我不想知道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我已经不想知道我的数字了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水面被玻璃瓶撞破，响动听起来沉闷而苦涩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"511013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"511013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-511013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-511013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……对不起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们都记得那句古老的教导，“认识你自己”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但最重要的答案早已被海浪卷走，陷入漫长无止境的漂流。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……抱歉，37，我想我暂时没办法回答你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这是个深刻的问题，现在的我无法这么轻易就给出答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>也许得等我回去后花些时间，好好想想，才能告诉你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>那么，37，我还要核对物资清单。希望你的研究顺利——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她平静且快速地说完了这段辞令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但想要转身离去并不容易，37径直抓住了苏菲亚的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>曾有人教过我解题技巧——在实在没有思路的时候，就应该试着转换心情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这招很有用，我检验过许多次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>既然苏菲亚还没有更重要的事要做，那就来和我们一起玩这个游戏吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你还没有自己参与过呢，休的游戏！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>要甩开这只手总是很艰难的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好吧……但我记得你承诺过，要在晚餐前结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然！反正6也还在环岛散步，在他数到四位数前，我们有的是时间！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>来吧，苏菲亚，接下来是这道题——</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-3"}}